        "line": 273,
        "text": "theorem norm_ofContDiffOn_le_iff {k : ℕ} (f : ℝ → E) (hf : ContDiffOn ℝ k f I)\n    {B : ℝ} (hB : 0 ≤ B) :\n    ‖ofContDiffOn f hf‖ ≤ B ↔ ∀ n ≤ k, ∀ x : I, ‖iteratedDerivWithin n f I x‖ ≤ B"
      }
